    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV - DON'T MISS OUT !!!  This instantly appealing and imposing 4 bed DETACHED south-east facing corner home with GARAGE, ideal for conversion, plus generous side entrance part enclosed providing additional living space is the ideal family home, further enhanced by neatly manicured gardens perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Quiet cul de sac setting with comfortable off-street parking for 3+ cars.  Large green spaces facilitate family living. The property enjoys spacious, light filled, well appointed accommodation upgraded over the years, the property is presented in turn-key condition with NO ONWARD CHAIN. Dodder Valley is a mature, exclusive enclave of modern homes built circa 1997 Firhouse provides a perfect balance of essential suburban shopping, community and recreational spaces, world-class regional parklands 100+ hectares stretching over 6 kilometers along the River Dodder,  local schools, Church, public transport etc., The nearby M50 provides ease of access to various routes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway with tiled flooring, Guest w.c whb with storage, fully tiled\r\nLounge: 3.72m X 5.27m with functional bay window, feature Marble fireplace, Mahogany surround, double-doors lead to the 2nd reception room\r\n2nd reception room : 4.35m X 2.88m door off to the dining area\r\nDining room: 4.49m X 2.76m with patio doors to the rear garden, tiled flooring\r\nKitchen: 4.49m X 2.39m Superb selection of Solid Oak shaker style units and presses, enclosed wall-mounted gas boiler, tiled splash area, tiled flooring, stainless steel extractor hood, hob and oven, plumbed for a washing machine and dishwasher, door off to the conservatory\r\nConservatory area to the side : 2.00m x 5.04m with solid perspex roofing, tiled flooring, French doors lead to both front and rear\r\nUtility room: 2.36m X 1.84m ideal for a tumble dryer, chest freezer, counter storage etc.,\r\nOutdoor entertaining space with clear corrugated perspex roof and slate flooring\r\nUPSTAIRS - wood flooring throughout, the bathrooms are tiled\r\nBedroom 1 : 2.55m x 2.61m wood flooring, built-in wardrobe\r\nMain Bedroom - 2 : 3.04m x 4.15m wood flooring, built-in wardrobes, En-suite: 1.97m x 2.07m Shower, whb with storage, wc. chrome heated towel rail. The floor and wall areas are fully tiled, window providing natural daylight and ventilation\r\nHot press with double doors\r\nBedroom 3 : 2.88m x 3.52m built-in wardrobe, wood flooring\r\nBedroom 4 : 2.38m x 2.81m wood flooring\r\nBathroom :  Over sized shower cubicle, whb with storage unit, wc, the floor and wall areas are fully tiled\r\nGARAGE : 3.15m x 2.37m up and over door, ideal for a wide range of usage or conversion."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "BER B  Ber No 118075977\r\nPVC double glazed windows throughout\r\nGas fired radiator central heating\r\nDigital alarm system\r\nTrip switch fuse board\r\nSolid Oak shaker style kitchen\r\n3 reception rooms / plus outdoor entertaining space\r\nUPGRADED guest wc/ main bathroom & en-suite\r\nAttic with pull down ladder\r\nWalled cobbled driveway providing excellent off-street parking, framed by established full-grown landscaping, side entrance to courtyard with bin storage area plus separate side entrance to the rear garden\r\nWalled garden to the rear, part clad with attractive rolled wood cladding, mature foliage, feature paved patio areas which take full advantage of the sun, the perfect setting for entertaining or relaxing"
      },
